{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two standard six-sided dice are rolled. If the two numbers on the top faces are multiplied, which of the following products is most likely?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/33789a037e2e024d2cfe2ea15353ada9eec72a1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 15\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We'll check the numbers of ways that each number could be made and then compare them to find out which one has the most.\n</p><p>Option A: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2f905037f94e8fb21271370773d7ad9a42d40d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/638ee7316e2377ea24df5d33afe4ead7a45fee2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c982107b84ad3417248f815feea6bb9a8677ec65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Option B: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/220993fd62e999c80512951fada16da3d1c60a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690247843f0f0c8a6eb340268a5df173a5578a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/60070619a4e65e13f60e6f83ae342a27431b413d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot2$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1bb2244be726a06c82134aeaf4ca5ff9dbd87f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Option C: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9fc44cf13887cfa02c6e660c2c69e1c6e6505e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot3$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Option D: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/411bbe402d009676519c54643806e29fd0b11861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot5$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a046ca0a60b81c28d68fccc490aa3e1d631d962.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Option E: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b86730b0044fc73ab4a3139ef8ef98de2e7e87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4f5d91d5af115c77f183708e8a44b311b4e993f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>In total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acb731121caae970888763e53d6453cc84a8c614.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) }\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"30\" /> has the most solutions which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, thus making it the most likely.\n</p><p>~any1sgame\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href